# c5: .report.json
# c6: .table.csv
# c7: --export
# c8: spectrum
# c9: --animate
seg-35965c7df95f = A run dispatches on the scenario's <c1/> and writes <c2/>, <c3/>, <c4/> (a printable report page in HTML, HyperText Markup Language) and <c5/> (the same report, machine-readable), plus <c6/> for the kinds that publish a table, next to the scenario file. <c7/> adds exchange files: CZML (the Cesium Language) and KML (Keyhole Markup Language) for globe viewers, GeoJSON for maps, STK (Systems Tool Kit) ephemeris files, and SigMF (Signal Metadata Format) recordings for the <c8/> kind. <c9/> adds an SVG, HTML or frame-by-frame animation.

